# The handover note stays off the remote: it names live defects and points at work
# parked on a local branch. It lives on disk and on the local branch `handover-local`.
# Untracking it takes it off the TIP, not out of history: the blobs are still reachable
# from af2a739 and the three commits after it, and af2a739's own message names the file.
docs/HANDOVER.md

