# The bench's own scratch live state, written under state/electric_chat/ by
# tools/electric_learn_bench.py. Same class as state/language_state.json above: a runtime dropping,
# regenerable by re-running the bench, never evidence. Added because the `state/**/*.npz` family
# covered six of its seven files and left `neural_lang.json` showing up as untracked noise.
# Convention unchanged from R10: state/ stays ignored, artifacts that must be consulted live in
# experiments/*/results/ and are re-included explicitly, never by un-ignoring this area.
state/electric_chat/
state/*.log
state/*.pid
state/battery_*.txt
state/holdout_*.txt
